#![recursion_limit = "256"]
//! Courier - P2P Protocol Layer
//!
//! This crate owns all protocol message types and handles peer connections.
//!
//! # Architecture (v3 - Simplified Ephemeral)
//!
//! ```text
//! Transport (dumb primitives)
//!     │
